  dialogueLines:
  - " Hello \u2026 um my name is Frieda"
  - like the artist!
  - "My mama said i\u2026i should not say im lost to anyone for i belong everywhere
    but home."
  - "But can I tell you something\u2026 I feel pretty lost with my bud Moshi Moshi"
  - 'My Tomogachi! '
  - 'if you bring us along, Moshi Moshi would make you feel all new and lively with
    his amazing charm. '
  - 'Can I ask you to give me a lift, I promise not to annoy you and be a burden
    like how I was to my mom and dad. '
  - Thank you so much!
  - "Mom was right\u2026 no one would give me a second chance, im just a burden to
    all.  "
